You jog with a weighted vest weighing you down. <span class="red">You feel a little worn out.</span><<gtiredness>><<tiredness 2>>
<br><br>
<<runicon>><<link [[Continue weighted cardio on the track (1:30)|Horse Academy Track Weight]]>><<endevent>><<willpower 5>><<pass 90>><<tiredness 10>><</link>><<gggwillpower>><<gggtiredness>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[Practice jogging on the track (1:30)|Horse Academy Track Train]]>><<endevent>><<athletics 5>><<pass 90>><<tiredness 2>><<set $speed to "jog">><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 250 700>><<ggathletics>><<gtiredness>>
