:: Horse Academy Ash Morning
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
"Oh you're finally awake, thought ya were gonna be sleepin' forever at this rate." Ash sighs and places <<his>> hand on <<his>> hip. "We gotta get some workin' in and get ya ready for the big race comin' up."
<br><br>
<<if $rng gt 75>>
	How about we work on ya athleticism, lets build up ya speed so you can keep up while racin'
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[Follow Ash (10:00)|Horse Academy Train Athletics]]>><<athletics 50>><<pass 600>><<tiredness 20>><<set C.npc.Ash.love += 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom += 1>><</link>><<glove>><<gdom>><<gggathletics>><<gggtiredness>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[Disobey Ash|Horse Academy Disobey]]>><<set $dailytrain to 1>><<rng>><<set C.npc.Ash.love -= 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom -= 1>><</link>><<llove>><<ldom>>
<<elseif $rng gt 50>>
	Lets build up ya physique a bit, keep ya strong enough to pass up them other racin' horses.
	<br><br>
	<<prisonicon "lift">><<link [[Follow Ash (10:00)|Horse Academy Train Physique]]>><<physique 50>><<pass 600>><<tiredness 60>><<set C.npc.Ash.love += 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom += 1>><</link>><<glove>><<gdom>><<gggphysique>><<gggtiredness>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[Disobey Ash|Horse Academy Disobey]]>><<set $dailytrain to 2>><<rng>><<set C.npc.Ash.love -= 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom -= 1>><</link>><<llove>><<ldom>>
<<elseif $rng gt 25>>
	We gotta work on ya footwork, keep ya able to turn them corners and not go slippin' to the ground.
	<br><br>
	<<dancestudioicon>><<link [[Follow Ash (10:00)|Horse Academy Train Dance]]>><<danceskill 50>><<pass 600>><<tiredness 20>><<set C.npc.Ash.love += 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom += 1>><</link>><<glove>><<gdom>><<gggdanceskill>><<gggtiredness>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[Disobey Ash|Horse Academy Disobey]]>><<set $dailytrain to 3>><<rng>><<set C.npc.Ash.love -= 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom -= 1>><</link>><<llove>><<ldom>>
<<else>>
	Now, how 'bout we start workin' on ya willpower, keep you on ya feet long enough to get to the finish line without collapsin'.
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[Follow Ash (10:00)|Horse Academy Train Willpower]]>><<willpower 50>><<pass 600>><<tiredness 60>><<set C.npc.Ash.love += 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom += 1>><</link>><<glove>><<gdom>><<gggwillpower>><<gggtiredness>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[Disobey Ash|Horse Academy Disobey]]>><<set $dailytrain to 4>><<rng>><<set C.npc.Ash.love -= 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom -= 1>><</link>><<llove>><<ldom>>
<</if>>

