:: Horse Academy Train Athletics
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
<<rng>>
<<if C.npc.Ash.love - C.npc.Ash.dom gte $rng>>
	Ash leads you to the practice track at the front of the academy. "We're gonna be trainin' ya speed today. You aughta do about a dozen laps on the track and we'll see ya progress."
	<br><br>
	You spend the day jogging. <span class="red">You feel exhausted.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	Ash begins to guide you before <<he>> stops on the spot and turns to you. "Ya know, I reckon most trainers'll be stickin' to standard trainin' but... I've got somethin' special for ya."
	<br><br>
	Ash grips your arm tight and pulls you into a deeper portion of the academy. <span class="red">The lights here are dim and it is hard to see but you hear strange noises around you.</span>
	<br><br>
	"Now that we got ya in the back where noone'll hear, we can begin ya <span class="red">"special"</span> trainin'..."
	<br><br>
	Ash leads you to an open room the size of an indoor pool with a small track. "Now... we're gonna let the horses out and we'll see how fast you can run."
	<<link [[Next|Horse Backroom Athletics]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

