:: Horse Backroom Whip
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
<<He>> cracks the whip <<his>> hands. "Now dodge if ya can, if not... I hope ya like pain."
<br><br>

<<if $danceskill gte 400>>
	You manage to evade the first lash. Ash pulls the whip back and aims at you once more.
	<<danceskill 5>>
<<else>>
	You cry out as pain erupts in your back. Ash pulls the whip back and aims at you once more.
	<<masopain 20>>
	<<danceskill 5>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $danceskill gte 600>>
	You manage to evade the second lash. Ash looks annoyed, pulling the whip back and aims at you yet again.
	<<danceskill 5>>
<<else>>
	The second lash lands, causing you to cry out as pain erupts from your back. Ash pulls the whip back and aims at you yet again.
	<<masopain 20>>
	<<danceskill 5>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $danceskill gte 800>>
	You manage to evade the third and final lash. Ash looks pissed yet also pleasantly surprised. "Wow that's some nice movin'. It almost makes me proud. I reckon I'll let ya off easy this time."
	<<danceskill 5>>
<<else>>
	The final lash lands, causing you to cry out in pain as your back is raw. Ash pants as <<he>> hangs back up the whip. "Train your footwork skills if ya don't want so much pain next time."
	<<masopain 20>>
	<<danceskill 5>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Ash grabs your arm, pulling you back to the front of the academy. "That is the end of our special trainin' you're free for the rest of the day, sugar."

<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><</link>>

:: Horse Backroom Athletics
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
You begin to sprint as the box at the end of the room opens and a large horse barrels out. Ash begins to laugh as <<he>> watches. "Run sugar run! Maybe you can escape if ya fast enough."
<<if $athletics gte 800>>
	You slowly start to gain distance from the horse before bursting out of the back rooms. You can hear Ash's laughter continue from the other room.
	<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<athletics 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You slowly begin to lose ground as the horse speeds up. Ash begins to laugh as <<he>> watches you get mowed over by the horse, pinned to the ground.
	<<link [[Next|Horse Chase Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<athletics 5>><</link>>
<</if>>

